        "filing_date": "2026-05-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through a network of distribution centers in the U.S., we offer more than 270,000 products from national brand manufacturers and our own brand of more than 4,000 high-quality products.",
